        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 7056WC, Half Round Winchester Knob with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Half Round Winchester Knob with Round Rose is a simple, traditional knob suitable for interior doors needing privacy, passage, or dummy functions. The Winchester Knobset with #2 Rosette will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This rustic knob is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Half Round Winchester Knob with Round Rose is made from sandcast bronze, for a unique finished look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/keyed-sandcast-bronze-winchester-knob-with-round-rosette-emtek-5102wc\"><b>Keyed Entry Winchester Knob with Round Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Winchester Half-Round Knob with #2 Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Sandcast Bronze Winchester Knobset with Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Steam: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
