                "title": "Sandcast Bronze Half Round Winchester Knob with Round Rose",
                "description": "The Sandcast Bronze Half Round Winchester Knob with Round Rose is a simple, traditional knob suitable for interior doors needing privacy, passage, or dummy functions. The Winchester Knobset with #2 Rosette will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This rustic knob is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Half Round Winchester Knob with Round Rose is made from sandcast bronze, for a unique finished look.",
